# Scene 3 — "Comparison as an instrument" (~60 s)
# Beats: two telescopes, one field — 5 h Vixen 102 vs 1 h TS80; Values in
# All Views fans the pointer out to every cell through the link transforms.
# MANUAL moment (presenter): press M, click a star in each view — one pair
# snaps the translation; Shift+M and a second star solve rotation + scale.
open NGC_6992_PI_GIMPR.jpg
waitloaded
open cygnus-dentelles-TS80.xisf
waitloaded
split 1x2
sleep 2500
activate 1
action values_everywhere
hover 400 300
sleep 900
hover 700 450
sleep 900
hover 950 380
sleep 900
hover 620 700
sleep 900
hover 500 520
sleep 1200
hover off
sleep 1000
# leave the stage set for the live Match clicks
